WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:03.850
Monitoring Tennouji Kotarou and Kanbe Kotori?

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.360
What? Have you grown 
attached to them or something?

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.220
They both saw the monsters in the forest.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.280
There is a risk Gaia will go after them.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.810
You've got a point.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.410
We need to keep an eye on
Tennouji just in case.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.690
What about Kotori?

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.920
That schoolgirl is missing, actually.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.910
She is?

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.590
I-In that case, I'll at least take care
of Kotarou personally—

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.220
No.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.130
That's impossible with your cover blown.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.620
However!

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.890
If there were some elite super agent 
whose cover was still intact,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.880
who knew Kazamatsuri like
the back of his own hand...

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:35.980
What do you think?

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.100
There's someone that remarkable 
in this organization?

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.650
Episode 9
"Fate Begins to Turn"

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.690
I finally got in touch with Kotori.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.740
May as well relax for once and take a bath—

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:18.440
Huh?

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:19.360
Kotarou.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.250
I need to talk to you.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.330
Come on. Think about where we are, first!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.770
I messed up!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.760
Me, of all people...

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.460
It slipped my mind that humans have a system
where they get naked in the bath.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:34.870
On that note,

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.340
I need to talk to you.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.200
He—Wai—N-N-No!

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.720
Kagari-san, you pervert!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.100
I've seen this guy's face somewhere before.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.850
He is quite a nice guy!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.230
Excellent!

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:55.070
Hey. What happened to all that stuff
about searching for yourself?

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.320
This house is too tiny for 
a big shot such as myself.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.640
As part of my search for myself,

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:04.060
you must take me to
the stylish and trendy city.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:07.700
I thought the cafeteria's feecof
was as good as it gets,

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.340
but this is superb, too!

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.050
Yeah.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.330
I more or less understand 
how your palate works now.

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:16.490
This is a valuable day off, too.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:18.210
What am I doing?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.160
Found him!

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.470
There he is.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.100
<b>I have taken the liberty of closing 
the shop for business today.</b>

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.100
<b>Please
forgive me.</b>

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.550
Man, he's off today?

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:30.160
I figured Esaka-san would be
well versed in strange subjects.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.510
Oh, well.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.850
Let us ask my fans for information about me.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.480
And who would they be, exactly?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.260
A number of people have been following us
ever since we set foot in the city.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.490
I am positive they are what you 
would call "fanatical groupies."

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.160
Seriously?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.680
<i>She's right. I do get the feeling
someone is there.</i>

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>Could this have something to do with
the incident in the forest?</i>

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.450
Why are we running away?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.040
It said on the Internet that fanservice is 
important for those who aspire to be idols.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.760
You're banned from the Internet from now on.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.900
He spotted me?

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.580
He ran away!

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.000
Was his intuition always that good?!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.890
Let's head him off from above!

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.520
This way!

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:24.910
Battle Kick!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.910
What school you from, punk?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.520
Is that the only thing you can say?!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.440
Y-You!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:32.580
Aren't you the king's—

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.120
Let's leave it at that.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.270
Th-The king!

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:39.300
How many times do I have to tell you?
Don't call me your king.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.300
Why, you ask?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.600
Because I am a lone wolf without a pack—

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.420
Y-You're Tennouji!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.180
Oh? It's the Yoshing.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.220
Don't randomly mix those names together!

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.820
You're playing around with
a different woman already?

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:55.300
Talk about living the high life.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.020
It's nothing like that.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.950
Sorry, but I don't have time 
to argue with you right now.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.110
It seems we're being chased.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.110
Did something come up?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.330
More or less.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.170
So, yeah, later.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:08.820
Wait up.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.860
Amateurs end up wandering through
this trash heap of a labyrinth forever.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.750
Take a right at the end of the alley.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:21.380
A world of light suited 
to you softies awaits.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:23.930
What is this Yoshing person talking about?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.880
Hey, that nickname's starting to spread!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.280
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:32.810
It will be me, and only me,

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:34.270
who puts an end to your life.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.140
Y-You're cool as hell, King.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.320
Thanks, man.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.400
Get out of here already.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.740
Also, Kotori really did catch a bad cold.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.990
She finally got in touch with me yesterday.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.120
Like I care.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:59.180
This thing is... a dog, right?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.750
<i>There's no opening.</i>

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.320
<i>Whoever makes the first move will lose!</i>

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:08.240
Gil-chan, I am sure he is right below us!

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.220
Dive bomb!

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.740
Oh, dear. I should have known better.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:16.850
What are these bugs?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:17.790
No.

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.730
They're talking monsters?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:20.980
<b>You're open!</b>

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:28.860
You damn dog!

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:31.950
Who are you guys?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.150
This is dark territory 
where light cannot reach.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:35.990
Huh?

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:40.000
However, even darkness has its own order.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.250
Fighting a dog is disgraceful, old man.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.020
Huh?

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.070
What're you talking about?

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.380
And what do you mean, old man?
I'm still in my twenties—

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.880
Go to Hell!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.600
Yoshino must have pulled 
through for us somehow!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.430
Kagari!

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.240
Hey, what's wrong?

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:04.520
Kotarou...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.130
I ran out of feecof...

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.530
Caffeine addiction?!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.600
I want it...

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:14.180
I want <i>it</i>!

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:13.030
C-Call the cops...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.180
Stop it!

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:15.960
Stop saying such misleading things in public!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:20.410
You could destroy my social standing!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.500
That totally wore me out.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:25.990
Oh, please go ahead.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:26.750
Huh?

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.510
Lucia?!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.010
Why are you here?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.880
I-I could ask you the same, Kotarou!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.510
I've been worried about you!

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.730
You all disappeared at the same time!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.770
It's better for you this way.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.750
Shizuru said the same thing, 
but how could I accept that?!

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.600
We're all friends from the occult club!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.360
Is it ready yet, Kotarou?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.380
Hurry.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.150
I want <i>it</i> right away...

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:51.320
Wait.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.110
This isn't what it looks like!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.470
You've having <i>plenty</i> of fun even 
without the occult club around,

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.430
aren't you, Tennouji-kun?

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.620
You're suddenly acting like
you don't know me?!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.630
To be serious for a second,

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.660
both we and Gaia are treating you

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.380
and Kanbe Kotori as subjects 
requiring special care.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.550
But, as long as nothing happens,

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.480
we'll end surveillance of you eventually.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.750
So forget about us already,

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.950
and lead an ordinary life.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.380
Good work!

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:26.000
Did anything happen on your end?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.020
No. Nothing in particular.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:28.920
Really?

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.300
There was nothing irregular
in my area, either.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:34.910
Now we just have to wait for
our senior colleagues to report in.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.160
Esaka-san and the others

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:39.770
are all former members of
the Bayern Knights of the Green Sword, right?

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:40.610
Yes.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.710
They are Guardian's greatest warriors.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.550
When I was still a trainee,

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.840
he would occasionally help out
as an instructor.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.170
But...

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:55.020
Having them return to active 
service does give me hope.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.550
Put another way,

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.810
Gaia has become so active that
they had to come back.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:07.080
I'm satisfied.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.970
After spending all day roaming the city,

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:10.820
I finally understand.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:15.600
This canned coffee reigns supreme!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:16.700
Oh, I see.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.560
So, what about your memory?

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:20.860
Yeesh...

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.870
I guess it's about time we headed home, then.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.480
Hey, I remember you.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.620
Y-You're...

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.660
And here I thought you were 
just some crappy hunter.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.340
Hey.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:34.840
How'd you take down my dog?

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.430
Are you a member of Gaia?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.850
What the hell else would I be?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.220
Are you really from Guardian?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.850
Who are you?

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.000
Kotarou is my minion.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.630
I won't allow him to be harmed.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:52.230
Kagari!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.640
You're pissin' me off.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:55.230
Outta my way, woman!

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:55.820
Stop!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.830
Hey, hey. What do we have here?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.580
You sure as hell don't look like 
you're that tough.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.580
Who the hell are you, bastard?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.660
Interesting.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:13.710
Go.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:25.430
Hey. What's with the girl?

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.980
She doesn't look like a 
Guardian superhuman to me.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:29.140
Huh?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.190
That reminds me.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.720
I've sensed her somewhere before...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.750
I get it.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:42.090
Looks like I reeled in the one that got away!

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:43.910
<i>What is this?</i>

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.620
<i>It's gotten really hot for some reason!</i>

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.750
Come out, Fogo.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.600
Ch-Chibi-Moth!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:53.590
Why are you here?

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.690
Are you telling us to run away?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.170
Got it!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.720
I'm gonna run as fast as I can.
Don't bite your tongue!

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:04.890
You punk.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.390
Who the hell would let you run away?!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.640
Adios!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.400
How's he so fast?

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.520
This is gettin' kinda fun!

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:27.400
<i>I ended up using my
newly-rewritten powers in public,</i>

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.540
<i>but at least we'll be okay now.</i>

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.400
That was impressive.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:33.730
I really am no ordinary person.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:38.250
I definitely have some huge mission,
like saving this planet.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.900
Yeah, I'll bet.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.810
Did that guy from this afternoon
make it all the way here?

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.560
K-Kotarou!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.350
<i></i>She's <i>scared?</i>

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.510
S-Sorry to intrude!

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:10.760
The feecof beans I secretly ordered online

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:15.160
and hid in the fridge were safe!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.000
You're <i>definitely</i> banned from the Internet.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.860
And wait.

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:20.360
I remember seeing that bug somewhere before.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.510
Who are you calling a bug, you jerk?!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.430
I'll teach you a thing or two for lookin' 
down on us, you rotten little brat!

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.540
So, is there anything else you'd like to say?

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.410
I'll bow down before you, so please help me!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.660
Not this life again.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:41.700
This apartment is even smaller
than the previous one.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:44.080
So you <i>are</i> those mysterious 
creatures from before.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:44.950
Hey.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.180
You're monsters, right?

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:48.640
What? You got a problem
with us being monsters?!

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:49.360
No.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:53.430
I'd just seriously like to ask you 
about Gaia and monsters and stuff.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:57.130
Ask all you like, but we are 
simply discarded monsters.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:58.630
We do not know very much.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.360
Not very useful, are you?

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:01.080
What the heck?!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.270
You're awfully cold for someone 
I formed a contract with!

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:04.380
A contract?

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.180
Oh, you mean <i>that</i>?

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:10.050
I'm a <i>super</i> useful monster!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.830
We followed you around all day today,

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.760
and you didn't notice at all!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.970
Oh, really?

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.440
You two were there, too?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.940
Speak up! What were you up to?!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.870
We were ordered to keep an eye on you!

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:24.640
Ordered?

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.200
By who?

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:27.490
W-Well...

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:30.530
Chibi-Moth!

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:31.970
Why are you here?

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:34.830
Who is it?

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.000
Kanbe Kotori

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:36.760
Kotori!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:38.980
Yes, hello?!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:39.750
Kotori!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:40.810
Kotori, is it you?!

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.500
<i>Kotarou-kun, please.</i>

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.260
<i>I want you to come to the forest right now.</i>

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:45.510
<i>Along with that girl.</i>

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:47.580
Huh?

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:56.350
What do you mean, come to the forest?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:57.910
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:13:57.910 --> 00:13:59.540
<i>I've been watching you two</i>

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.900
<i>through Chibi-Moth's eyes this whole time.</i>

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.160
Through Chibi Moth?

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.340
<i>Since you were marked by Guardian and Gaia,</i>

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.280
<i>I was sure you'd be dragged into it</i>

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.910
<i>if they found out her true identity.</i>

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.540
You knew about Gaia and Guardian?

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:16.260
<i>I didn't know that Chi-chan and the rest</i>

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.840
<i>were organization members, though.</i>

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.290
You'll tell me everything, right?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.040
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.420
<i>I'll tell you everything I can.</i>

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.220
Here?

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.300
But there's nothing—

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:28.550
Huh?!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:30.460
Hurry inside!

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:31.430
It'll close right away!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.950
Is this really the forest?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.050
And there are monsters...

00:15:01.110 --> 00:15:02.460
Sorry I rushed you!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:06.040
They would have found this place if
I didn't close the barrier right away!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:06.970
Kotori!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.470
It's been a while.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.840
Welcome to Kotori-san's secret base!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.840
Secret base?

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:15.220
I feel as though I know this place.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.330
Well, you were born here, Kagari.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:19.600
But what a surprise.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.850
You were like a ghost at first.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.340
And now, you're so human.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.100
Kotori.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:29.990
You could see Kagari from the 
very beginning, couldn't you?

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:31.460
Yeah.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.160
I could see her all along.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.810
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.600
It wasn't something I could bring up easily.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.280
Does that mean you know everything about me?

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:45.420
Except for what you were up to
whenever you escaped this place.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:49.220
I've been waiting to meet a human like you!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:49.970
Huh?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.800
It appears this will be the finale of
my journey to find myself!

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.260
Oh, thanks for your help.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.800
You can go home now.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:58.930
She cast me aside?!

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.690
You really are a completely
different person now.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:02.550
Damn you!

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:03.930
Let me out of here!

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:06.560
There are treaties against abusing prisoners!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.280
Are these all monsters?

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:09.960
Yes.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.590
They are all monsters I created, 
so they're not dangerous.

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:14.690
You created them?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.990
And that little one is
actually a monster, too.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.890
I made him look like a dog with a technique
that disguises his appearance.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:27.020
Kotori, what were you doing in this forest?

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.370
If you use monsters, does that mean...

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.250
Our goal of safeguarding the Key is the same,

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.680
but I'm not with Gaia.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.580
And of course, I'm not with Guardian, either.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.850
I am a Druid.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.020
A Druid?

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:44.150
Hey, do you know about the Mistletoe?

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.450
If I recall, it's a parasitic plant
that grows on trees?

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:53.110
A long time ago, a monster user sealed
all his knowledge into a Mistletoe

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.780
and left it for future generations.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:57.130
He did that so he could
pass on his knowledge,

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.950
and his duty, to one who was worthy.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:03.660
It was ten years ago, I believe.

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.100
Deep in the forest,

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.120
by sheer coincidence, I met the Mistletoe

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:32.550
and became a Druid.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.360
That's when I gained knowledge,

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.610
and had a number of wishes granted.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.500
<i>An accident ten years ago?</i>

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:47.290
<i>Why didn't I know something 
like that happened?</i>

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:51.180
And, in exchange for those wishes,
I was given a duty.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.170
That mission was to protect the Key.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.610
To protect Kagari.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:00.440
We call that person the Key.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.710
I see.

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.310
Kagari was the Key?

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.440
You even knew about the Key?

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.730
Uh, kind of.

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:12.240
So ultimately, what am I, Kagari-chan?

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.390
Or should I say Key-chan?

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.320
Key-chan?

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.360
It might be best if you saw for yourself.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:24.590
Gaia and Guardian have been fighting 
over the Key for ages now.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.490
All so they can fulfill the same goal.

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:28.670
The same goal?

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.570
To save this world.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.800
Save the world?

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:38.760
Right now, Kazamatsuri City 
is in a volatile situation

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:43.100
due to an individual who holds the key
to Earth's survival or its destruction.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.930
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:53.250
This is where I met the Mistletoe, 
and where Kagari was born.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.260
It's a power spot.

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.250
This place is...

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.570
When we came to the forest 
with the occult club,

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.420
you wandered over here, remember?

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:04.930
That happened because Kagari 
carelessly lifted the barrier.

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.450
I was so surprised!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.080
Now, come over here.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.250
<i>It's just like that power of mine.</i>

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:20.330
Oh, you'll melt if you touch it,
so be careful.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.890
This is the energy of the Earth itself.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.640
The Key is born from here, in human form,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.350
as an avatar of the Earth.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.520
Did you remember anything?

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.600
It looks like it would feel great to soak in.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.070
You'll melt if you do that!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.070
Kotarou-kun, do you remember 
the rainbow-colored swamp?

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:44.070
That was actually caused by this power spot.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.280
It wasn't environmental pollution?

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.330
Thanks to this,

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:52.640
I can control lots of monsters 
without reducing my life span.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.630
Your lifespan?

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:58.260
Practitioners control monsters by 
chipping away at their life.

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:02.020
The stronger, or larger the number,
of monsters you control,

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:04.010
the more life they consume.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:10.240
B-By the way, why was Kagari 
born from here again?

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.070
I don't know all the details.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:14.330
But, depending on the Key's final ruling,

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:16.190
they say Salvation will occur.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.410
What's this Salvation?

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:19.100
Nobody has ever seen it,

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.180
so we won't know until it happens.

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:25.240
Sorry to drag you into 
all this strange stuff.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:26.920
Kotori.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:29.830
What're you talking about?

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.620
Aren't we...

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:38.420
I love you!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.500
I want you to go out with me!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.220
Thank you.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.220
I'm very happy.

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.880
But I'm sorry.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.470
I'm so sorry!

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:59.040
Aren't we best friends?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.990
Kotarou-kun...

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:04.770
Besides, this is total proof of the occult!

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:08.120
With this, I'll get my hands on 
the president's boobs for sure!

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.590
Her boobs gonna get got!

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:10.870
Jeez...

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.000
No debauchery. Let's keep it PG.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.610
Kagari?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.250
I hear a song.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:30.190
Huh?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.250
Are you all right?

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.460
I've been getting terrible headaches lately.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.990
Well, yeah.

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:57.790
Anyone would if they listened 
to that weird singing all day.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.750
I hate that song.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.420
By the way, any updates on
what we talked about before?

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:05.010
Um, it will probably happen this evening.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:06.170
Step it up.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.400
The situation will only 
go downhill from here.

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:09.260
Does that mean...

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.840
The hunters and monster users will start

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:13.890
fighting to the death.

00:22:18.390 --> 00:22:22.170
Not only did you lose the target, 
you came back all beat up?

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:23.480
I couldn't help it!

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:26.120
Where in the world did Kotarou and Kotori go?

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:26.740
I couldn't use my powers 
on ordinary citizens!

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:28.000
Leave it at that.

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.360
Now that Gaia's using the Harvest Festa

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:37.480
to bring in a large number of
monster users to Kazamatsuri,

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:40.290
we have no time to waste
 on unknown factors.

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:43.800
From now on, I will have you
focus on locating the Key.

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:45.300
Prepare yourselves.

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.920
This year, it will be more 
than a minor skirmish!

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:48.930
Yes, sir!

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:56.070
Great. I get the gist of the location.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:58.800
But there's some sort of barrier!

00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:01.060
You cannot get in unless 
it is opened from the inside!

00:23:01.220 --> 00:23:02.620
That won't be a problem.

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:04.030
Thank you for your hard work.

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.270
I am very anxious about 
leaving her side right now,

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:11.070
but this, too, is for Chihaya-san's sake.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:13.570
Prepare yourself, Kotarou-kun.

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:24.130
I finally caught you.

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:29.040
Shimako, you're a genius at hide-and-seek.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:48.970
You're preparing something like this?

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:52.820
You really do intend to
end the world, don't you,

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:54.910
Kashima Sakura?
